# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NPL 2026 (NetTV / EZDRM Widevine) — Lumbini Lions vs Sudurpaschim Royals
# The EZDRM license token expires ~16 min after the account Bearer is issued,
# so a static license_key rots almost immediately. In jhyap-tv the backend
# mints a live token at play time from the jhyap.license_mint_url below (using
# the stored Bearer) — just keep the Bearer fresh via POST /api/bearer.
# The static license_key is a best-effort fallback for OTT Navigator only.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-name="npl-2026" group-title="Nepali",LBL vs SPR (NPL 2026)
#KODIPROP:inputstream=inputstream.adaptive
#KODIPROP:inputstream.adaptive.manifest_type=mpd
#KODIPROP:inputstream.adaptive.license_type=com.widevine.alpha
#KODIPROP:jhyap.license_mint_url=https://ott-resources.geniustv.geniussystems.com.np/subscriber/sports/v1/namespaces/5/subscribers/5422901/stbs/janamk_fbtmd-5/cricket/matches/a-rz--cricket--yC2103164684294324257/stream-url
#KODIPROP:inputstream.adaptive.license_key=https://jhyap-tv.iamzanam.workers.dev/mint-license?u=https%3A%2F%2Fott-resources.geniustv.geniussystems.com.np%2Fsubscriber%2Fsports%2Fv1%2Fnamespaces%2F5%2Fsubscribers%2F5422901%2Fstbs%2Fjanamk_fbtmd-5%2Fcricket%2Fmatches%2Fa-rz--cricket--yC2103164684294324257%2Fstream-url
https://lb-ottnp.nettvstreamz.com/live_dash/npl_live-26/manifest.mpd
